格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"The OpenClaw of DeepSeek Harness — turn DSH into a multi-platform chat agent with in-chat trajectory tracing, subagents & cron, and one-command deploy.","id":"gh:1336179025","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-overdrive","slug":"temotee2103/dsh-overdrive","topics":["chatbot","deepseek-harness","dingtalk","discord-bot","dsh","dsh-plugin","feishu","slack-bot","telegram-bot","whatsapp-bot"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"The OpenClaw of DeepSeek Harness — turn DSH into a multi-platform chat agent with in-chat trajectory"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" tracing, subagents & cron, and one-command deploy."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# ⚡ dsh-overdrive"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> **The OpenClaw of DeepSeek Harness — turn DSH into the chat agent you can see thinking, ready in o"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"law of DeepSeek Harness — turn DSH into the chat agent you can see thinking, ready in one command.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**English** | **中文**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"`dsh-overdrive` is the **Hermes Agent / OpenClaw alternative built on DeepSeek Harness** — bridging "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"into **WhatsApp · Telegram · Discord · Slack · 飞书 · 钉钉 · 企业微信**, with the difference they don't have"},{"id":"p5s3","text":": **every thought and tool call is visible inside the chat**, and dangerous operations always wait f"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"ought and tool call is visible inside the chat**, and dangerous operations always wait for your tap."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Why not just OpenClaw?"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Hermes / OpenClaw give you a terminal agent behind 20+ chat channels — but it's a **black box**. You"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" see the answer, not the work."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"DSH's append-only session log is the one thing they can't copy. `dsh-overdrive` makes that power **c"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"only session log is the one thing they can't copy. `dsh-overdrive` makes that power **chat-native**:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- 🧠 **See it think** — `/trace` replays the agent's full reasoning & tool-call trajectory as a summa"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ry card, right in the chat\n- 🤖 **Command a team** — `/task` spawns parallel subagents, `/cron 0 9 * "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"* * …` schedules recurring jobs on a built-in scheduler\n- 🔒 **You approve the dangerous stuff** — a "},{"id":"p9s4","text":"risky tool call pauses until you tap **✅ Approve / 🚫 Reject** (native buttons on Telegram / Discord "},{"id":"p9s5","text":"/ Slack / WhatsApp)\n- 🚀 **One command to deploy** — `docker compose up`, scan a QR, start chatting. "},{"id":"p9s6","text":"No public URL needed for most platforms."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## What it looks like"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"As plain text / 纯文本版"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"🎬 Full demo script → docs/demo.md"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Follow the 3-minute script in docs/demo.md: chat → `/trace` replay → `/task` subagent → `/cron` sche"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"dule → approval tap → wrap-up."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Supported platforms"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Platform | Integration | Status |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| **Telegram** | Bot API (long-polling) | ✅ verified on real DSH (2026-08-16) |\n| **WhatsApp** | Bai"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"leys + QR pairing, native interactive buttons | ✅ |\n| **Discord** | Bot token, native buttons | ✅ |\n"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"| **Slack** | Socket Mode (no public URL) | ✅ |\n| **飞书 Feishu** | Official SDK, WS long-connection |"},{"id":"p17s4","text":" ✅ |\n| **钉钉 DingTalk** | Stream mode (WebSocket, no public URL) | ✅ |\n| **企业微信 WeCom** | Callback AP"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"I (AES) | ✅ |\n| **WeChat** (personal) | iLink / ClawBot protocol (experimental, v0.2b) | 🧪 已实现，需真实设备"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"验证 |\n| CLI | stdin/stdout (dev & E2E) | ✅ |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Docker — one command (recommended):**"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"**Already running DSH? One line:**"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"> **gateway-core 的 token 配置**：\n> - **图形界面（推荐给非技术用户）**：装好插件后，在 **DSH Web 设置 → Plugins → overdrive** 里"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"填 Telegram Bot Token（保存后重启 `dsh web` 生效）。\n> - **进程内原生模式**：设置环境变量 `DSH_TELEGRAM_TOKEN=<bot token>`（@B"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"otFather 创建）后重启 `dsh web`，直接在 DSH 里聊 Telegram。\n> - 旧外部 gateway 模式：设置 `DSH_OVERDRIVE_TOKEN=<token>`（D"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"SH 与 gateway 进程共用），或\n> - 在 profile 的 `cordis.patch.yml` 覆盖条目：`- update: [{ id: overdrive-gateway-cor"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"e, config: { token: <token> } }]`\n> - 未配置任何 token 时插件**以禁用态加载**（打印告警、桥接不启动），**不会**阻塞 `dsh` 启动，可随时补配后"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"config: { token: <token> } }]`\n> - 未配置任何 token 时插件**以禁用态加载**（打印告警、桥接不启动），**不会**阻塞 `dsh` 启动，可随时补配后重启。"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"First message to your bot? Run `/help` inside the chat. Full options: docs/quickstart.md"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Don't code? Do this."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"No terminal skills needed. dsh-overdrive is designed to be **installed by one person, used by everyo"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"rminal skills needed. dsh-overdrive is designed to be **installed by one person, used by everyone**."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"1. Ask a tech-savvy friend for **10 minutes**\n2. Send them this:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"**macOS / Linux:**"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"**Windows:** download install.ps1, right-click → \"Run with PowerShell\" (or double-click)"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"3. The installer asks 3 questions (API key → platform → bot token) and starts everything for you\n4. "},{"id":"p31s2","text":"From then on **you** just chat: send messages, `/help` for commands, tap **✅ Approve / 🚫 Reject** fo"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"* just chat: send messages, `/help` for commands, tap **✅ Approve / 🚫 Reject** for dangerous actions"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"> 中文：不需要会写代码。找懂行的朋友花 10 分钟装好，之后你只需要聊天：发消息、`/help`、危险操作点【同意/拒绝】。"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Chat commands"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| Command | What it does |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| `/help` | List commands |\n| `/trace` | Replay the latest turn's trajectory (thoughts + tool calls)"},{"id":"p35s2","text":" |\n| `/task <prompt>` | Spawn a subagent |\n| `/cron <min hour dom mon dow> <prompt> [--tz <IANA>]` |"},{"id":"p35s3","text":" Schedule a recurring job (optional timezone) |\n| `/crons` | List scheduled cron jobs (with next run"},{"id":"p35s4","text":" time) |\n| `/cronrm <task-id>` | Delete a scheduled cron job |\n| `/remind in 10 分钟 <text>` | One-sho"},{"id":"p35s5","text":"t reminder (`at HH:MM` also works) |\n| `/context <topic>` | Bind a topic to this conversation (`off`"},{"id":"p35s6","text":" clears, no arg shows) |\n| `/remember <fact>` | Remember something about the user (long-term memory)"},{"id":"p35s7","text":" |\n| `/recall <query>` | Recall relevant memories |\n| `/forget <memory-id>` | Delete a memory |\n| `/"},{"id":"p35s8","text":"send <path>` | Send a local file/image into this chat |\n| `/status` | Adapter / memory / cron status"},{"id":"p35s9","text":" overview |\n| `/digest` · `/digest daily 09:00` | Instant or scheduled daily summary |\n| `/feed add "},{"id":"p35s10","text":"<rss-url>` · `/feed list` · `/feed rm <id>` | RSS subscriptions pushed into the chat |\n| `/agents` |"},{"id":"p35s11","text":" Subagent status (simplified) |\n| `/new` | Reset the conversation |"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"> Agent-produced files (images/docs) are **auto-sent** to the chat at the end of each turn (scan the"},{"id":"p36s2","text":" agent workspace, base64 over the protocol)."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"`packages/gateway-core` is a **DSH plugin** (`dsh.bundle.patch` ready) exposing a Remote Session Dri"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"ver API; `packages/gateway` is a standalone multi-platform gateway. The \"soul\" — trajectory, approva"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"l, multi-agent — lives in the plugin, so the narrative survives plugin-API churn."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
